## 总览

ESP32-P4 无内置 WiFi。通过 esp_hosted 方案，使用 ESP32-C6 作为 WiFi 协处理器，经 SDIO 接口通信，为 ESP32-P4 Function EV Board 添加 WiFi 功能。

**共 7 个执行步骤，涉及 3 个修改文件 + 7 个新增文件 + 1 个仓库引入。**

---

## 步骤 1：修改 manifest 引入 esp_hosted 仓库

**文件：** `contest2026_261_PYxuexibiji.xml`

在 `<project path="contest2026_261_PYxuexibiji" ...>` 之前添加：

```xml
<remote fetch="https://github.com/espressif" name="espressif"/>
<project path="external/esp_hosted" name="esp-hosted" remote="espressif"
         revision="master" clone-depth="1"/>
```

> 如果竞赛环境不允许访问外部 GitHub，需将 esp-hosted fork 到 open-vela 组织下，改用 `remote="openvela"`。

**执行：** `repo sync -c -j8 external/esp_hosted`

---

## 步骤 2：Kconfig 添加 WiFi 配置选项

**文件：** `board/esp32p4/esp32p4-function-ev-board/Kconfig`

将现有空 Kconfig 替换为：

```kconfig
if ARCH_BOARD_ESP32P4_FUNCTION_EV_BOARD

menuconfig ESP32P4_WIFI_HOSTED
	bool "ESP-Hosted WiFi support (ESP32-C6 co-processor)"
	default n
	depends on ARCH_CHIP_ESP32P4
	select NET
	select NETDEV_LATEINIT
	select SCHED_LPWORK
	---help---
		Enable WiFi via esp_hosted using an external ESP32-C6
		co-processor connected over SDIO bus.

if ESP32P4_WIFI_HOSTED

config ESP32P4_WIFI_HOSTED_SDIO_BUS
	int "SDIO bus number"
	default 2
	---help---
		SDIO bus connecting ESP32-P4 (host) to ESP32-C6 (slave).
		Default SDIO2 uses GPIO8-15.

config ESP32P4_WIFI_HOSTED_GPIO_DATA_RDY
	int "GPIO pin: DATA_READY from co-processor"
	default 16
	---help---
		GPIO used by ESP32-C6 to interrupt ESP32-P4 when data
		is ready. Must not conflict with SDIO pins (GPIO8-15).

config ESP32P4_WIFI_HOSTED_SPI_FREQ
	int "SDIO clock frequency (Hz)"
	default 20000000
	---help---
		SDIO clock frequency. Start with 20MHz, can go higher
		if signal integrity allows.

endif # ESP32P4_WIFI_HOSTED

endif # ARCH_BOARD_ESP32P4_FUNCTION_EV_BOARD
```

